"""Настройки: everything one sets on a tablet with Haltia, in large type.

    haltia-settings [--page network|sound|screen|places|notify|time|updates|about]

Two panes in landscape (the sections on the left, the chosen one on the
right), one at a time on a portrait screen. The sections: the network (Wi-Fi
through NetworkManager), sound and vibration (PulseAudio, the touch
filter's buzz), the screen (brightness, turning, when it goes off), the
panel and the home screen (which programs, in which order), notifications
(mako through haltia-mako), date and time (timedated, from
openrc-settingsd), updates (haltia-update) and «О системе». A long press on
«О системе» shows «Для помощника»: the touch filter's values, the terminal,
the update log, going back to any kept update, and hiding programs.

A new Wi-Fi network's password is asked here and kept with the connection
for every user (NetworkManager's system connection), so no secret agent
(nm-applet) is needed afterwards.
"""
